WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }
::cue(c.credits) { color: #a8c7fa; font-size: 78%; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:03.370
Get running, get running

3
00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:06.460
holding our flag high in the sky

4
00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:18.060
Cross this endless sea with me and search for

5
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.810
a global miracle no one

6
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.940
has yet been able to find

7
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:27.960
With our hearts pounding,

8
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.710
we'll just charge ahead as we please, following

9
00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:35.590
the footprints of those who pursue their dreams

10
00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:39.390
No matter how stormy the night,

11
00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:42.390
if we put our minds together,

12
00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:46.540
we'll get through it

13
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:47.860
always

14
00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.590
Get running, get running

15
00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:54.550
holding our flag high in the sky

16
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.140
Even though there are tears

17
00:00:57.230 --> 00:01:00.580
we don't want anyone to see

18
00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.520
Keep chasing, keep chasing

19
00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:06.520
the compass that leads to our dreams

20
00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.230
always points straight ahead

21
00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.400
We can't stop here

22
00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.490
Get running, get running,

23
00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:24.540
head past everyone else

24
00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:27.120
So long as we don't run from it,

25
00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:30.540
we can take hold of tomorrow

26
00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.630
Keep chasing, keep chasing

27
00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.510
everything we see in the moment,

28
00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.930
we should record it all

29
00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:41.430
in the blank slates of our minds

30
00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.100
Luffy,

31
00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:08.100
hurry up and get over here!

32
00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:16.070
<b>We're Not in Hell</b>

33
00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:53.820
We're all set to depart anytime now!

34
00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:56.070
Once Luffy gets back, we can set sail!

35
00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:57.250
Okay.

36
00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:08.120
Look, simply put, there are about
as many battleships as there are of us.

37
00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:13.540
Even if we do set sail,
it's virtually impossible to get out of here.

38
00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.140
This is a report from northwest of the main gate.

39
00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:19.600
We have retrieved all
Enies Lobby's marines and officials.

40
00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:22.430
Also, at the main gate,

41
00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:26.930
we identified about fifty pirates—
including the giants—escaping the main island.

42
00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:28.550
It's those guys!

43
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.300
That's Zambai and the others!
See! I told you! They escaped the island just fine!

44
00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.510
I wasn't worried about them at all!

45
00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:40.250
Really, they wouldn't die!
Not even if you killed them!

46
00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.630
Just the other day–

47
00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:47.570
We have completely eliminated them
with a barrage of cannon fire.

48
00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:49.160
All are confirmed dead.

49
00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:53.960
Under these circumstances,
it's impossible to survive on the main island.

50
00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:57.950
Hence, the number of survivors
on Enies Lobby's main island is zero!

51
00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.090
Reporting from Battleship 2.

52
00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:06.010
The courthouse and the Tower of Justice
located in the southeast of the island,

53
00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.320
as well as the underground passage
that leads to the bridge,

54
00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:11.030
have all been destroyed.

55
00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:16.650
The only target left is the Bridge of Hesitation.

56
00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.680
Franky!

57
00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:34.330
Those guys!

58
00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:41.550
Alright, you guys go straight to the courthouse and meet up with Straw Hat-san.

59
00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.460
We're gonna split into two groups
and bring down that drawbridge.

60
00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:49.930
Galley-La's shipwrights, too?

61
00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:55.390
When you see those guys, tell them,

62
00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:59.190
"You're fired."

63
00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:02.900
Oimo! Kashi!

64
00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.610
How...

65
00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.740
dare you...

66
00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:09.780
deceive us?!

67
00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:14.250
I guess Yokozuna was with them, too.

68
00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.290
Do you wanna come along?

69
00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:28.720
Sodom and Gomorrah, too! Everyone!

70
00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:38.440
He says, "I'll be faithful
to Big Bro Franky for the rest of my life!"

71
00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:51.230
That trench mortar hit him in the chest!

72
00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:52.830
Get over here before he falls!

73
00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:56.580
No one's getting saved 
unless you guys keep moving!

74
00:05:57.510 --> 00:06:00.070
How is it...

75
00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:02.380
that people can die so easily?

76
00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.720
You can't see people on a map.

77
00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:14.350
They just erased a small island from the world map,
all without a shred of emotion.

78
00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.600
That's what a buster call is!

79
00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:28.860
Bro! We came to rescue you-waina!

80
00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:31.690
Bro! Come home with us!

81
00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.810
Hurry up, Straw Hat!

82
00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:42.380
Your friends are here waiting for you!

83
00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.840
Don't you dare die on us!

84
00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:51.890
Franky!

85
00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.260
Rubber Rubber...

86
00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.310
Jet Pistol!

87
00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.440
He jumped backwards to reduce the impact!

88
00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.730
Finger Pistol!

89
00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.920
Jet Bullet!

90
00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:28.510
Twin Jet Pistol!

91
00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.310
Rubber Rubber...

92
00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.120
I'll show you...

93
00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:46.270
my most potent technique,
one that pushes the Six Powers to their limit!

94
00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.530
Six Powers Esoterica:

95
00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:52.610
Six King Gun!

96
00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:19.770
It's like... the impact dials from Sky Island,

97
00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:26.250
but it's several times more powerful!

98
00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.360
Tempest Kick: Victory Bird!

99
00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:35.330
Luffy!

100
00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.160
Lucci is powerful.

101
00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:43.960
If Straw Hat hadn't held him back in there,

102
00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:47.540
to be honest,
I don't know how many of us would've died.

103
00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:51.050
You know, sometimes I feel...

104
00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:58.680
Luffy always knows from the start
the person he has to fight.

105
00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:02.140
I'm definitely gonna beat up that pigeon guy.

106
00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:05.940
He just has animal instincts...
even better than your own.

107
00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:14.710
I have a report, sir!

108
00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:17.610
Straw Hat Luffy is in the first column!

109
00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:19.030
So he's alive?

110
00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:23.200
Tell all ships to take position
around the Bridge of Hesitation!

111
00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:25.870
– Yes, sir!
– Let's go! Hurry up!

112
00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.800
He won't... die, right?

113
00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:35.220
Are you an idiot?

114
00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.130
What'd you say?!

115
00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:39.350
Only an idiot calls others idiots!

116
00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:00.530
What's going on?

117
00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.200
The wall?

118
00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:07.370
The first column is now cut off!

119
00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:18.040
They destroyed half the bridge!

120
00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:19.590
Why'd they do that?!

121
00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:25.600
Mr. Rob Lucci of CP9 and Straw Hat Luffy
are in the first column!

122
00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:29.560
The battleships are coming this way!

123
00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:34.820
All ships, take position around the Bridge of Hesitation!

124
00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:37.360
On both the bridge and escort ship,

125
00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:41.370
we have identified nine pirates,
including Pirate Hunter Zoro and Nico Robin!

126
00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:46.870
It appears that they're the main culprits
who defeated CP9 in the Tower of Justice!

127
00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:51.210
They'll recapture Robin!

128
00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:54.550
We're not gonna let them!

129
00:10:57.430 --> 00:11:00.290
At any rate, they're fierce.

130
00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:03.370
The legendary Enies Lobby
has stood impregnable for 800 years,

131
00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:07.020
all because CP9 has watched over it
for many generations.

132
00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:10.060
And yet, a single group of pirates defeated CP9,

133
00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.090
and their captain can contend
with Mr. Rob Lucci, of all people.

134
00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:17.030
It seems that Straw Hat Luffy is no mere rookie.

135
00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:20.110
But he can't defeat Mr. Lucci.

136
00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:24.320
And we will clearly annihilate his crew here.

137
00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.990
This is the end of the road for these villains.

138
00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.750
Hey, look over there!

139
00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.640
Luffy-kun!

140
00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.860
We're here!

141
00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:53.440
We all got to the bridge, safe and sound!

142
00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.660
We're okay!

143
00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:01.500
You don't have to worry about us, Luffy-kun!

144
00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.610
We rescued Robin-chan, too!

145
00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:08.290
All that's left is for you to beat him!

146
00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.120
Take him down, Luffy!

147
00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.530
We'll all make it through this...

148
00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:13.080
and leave this place!

149
00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.810
Now it's just a matter of how long
we can hold them off.

150
00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:42.030
It's as you said, your friends are all still alive.
Incredible.

151
00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:48.230
But we'll see if you still have
that look on your face a few minutes from now.

152
00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:50.490
Evil cannot be allowed to thrive in this world!

153
00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.400
Stand down if ranked lieutenant commander or below!

154
00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:59.170
As for the 200 elite captains and commanders, eliminate the enemy on the double!

155
00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.510
C-Captains from Headquarters?!

156
00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:05.590
They're in the same class as that Smoker freak!

157
00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:08.050
We're taking on that many guys at that level?!

158
00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:10.560
That's proof they're scared of us.

159
00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.940
Grandma, I'm scared.

160
00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.620
Hm? Where's Sanji?

161
00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:33.790
He was here just a moment ago.

162
00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:37.960
What? Where'd that idiot cook go at a time like this?

163
00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:41.870
All hands prepare for battle! Move out!

164
00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:45.050
Yeah!

165
00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:54.900
Talk is cheap; bring it on already!

166
00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:59.520
Nice. I get to go wild one more time.

167
00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:03.480
We'll draw the line here
and give it everything we've got!

168
00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:06.400
Hold your ground until Luffy gets back,
no matter the cost!

169
00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:10.200
We have to get off the ship! If it's damaged,
we'll lose our chance to escape!

170
00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:12.660
They will never catch me again!

171
00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:19.500
I can't move!

172
00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.540
Attack!

173
00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.510
Recover Nico Robin!

174
00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:31.300
We can't let them take her back after having come so far!

175
00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:35.450
Two hundred elites from Navy Headquarters?
Fine by me!

176
00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:37.560
But there are so many of them!

177
00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:39.480
Weapons...

178
00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.060
Left!

179
00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:47.780
Only dealing with one or two at a time is such a hassle. Attack me all at once!

180
00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:52.870
Feel the power of Sogeking!

181
00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.240
Sunflower Star!

182
00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:06.340
So you're looking for a fight
using guns and cannons?!

183
00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:10.590
Take this!

184
00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:13.660
That doesn't work on me!

185
00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.850
Weapons Left!

186
00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:21.900
You're not getting away from me!

187
00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.980
Strong Right!

188
00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:42.220
Grandma, the Navy's on its way!

189
00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:44.170
That's not good.

190
00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:49.130
Robin, stay here. I'll hold them back!

191
00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.360
Here I come!

192
00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:56.610
Thunder Charge:

193
00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:01.350
Swing Arm!

194
00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.730
Thunder Ball!

195
00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:14.950
– What's this?!
– Clouds?!

196
00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.660
Thunderbolt Tempo!

197
00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.470
I did it!

198
00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:27.560
You think you can fight us
with that joke of a weapon?!

199
00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:28.840
You pirate bitch!

200
00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:40.720
Robin!

201
00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:46.730
I'm part of the Straw Hats, too.
When we fight, let's do so together.

202
00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:52.360
There's more?!

203
00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:57.240
Hey there! We're hostages!

204
00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.090
We're weak!

205
00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:19.260
Stay strong until Luffy gets here!

206
00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.310
Shave!

207
00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.160
What's the matter?

208
00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:42.040
It seems that doping technique of yours is losing its edge.

209
00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.920
Your struggle means nothing!

210
00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.960
Enies Lobby is your last stop after all!

211
00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.460
That's just reality!

212
00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:56.840
Rubber Rubber Jet Axe!

213
00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:59.510
I don't care if this island is destroyed in the process.

214
00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.670
That woman is a threat
to the World Government's agenda.

215
00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:08.310
I will pursue her to the ends
of the earth to eliminate her...

216
00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.810
in the name of dark justice!

217
00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:15.280
We came here to take Robin away from all that!

218
00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.240
Jet Stamp!

219
00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.040
Six King Gun!

220
00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:28.780
Luffy!

221
00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:33.900
– I got him!
– Watch out!

222
00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:37.900
Hey! Now's not the time
to be spacing out, Soge–

223
00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:51.220
Luffy!

224
00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:55.790
Luffy!

225
00:19:56.600 --> 00:20:00.260
What're you doing?!

226
00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:03.220
Get up!

227
00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:07.230
Luffy!

228
00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:10.480
Weapons Left!

229
00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:21.650
Super!

230
00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:26.030
Commander!

231
00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.280
What's with those pirates?!

232
00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:31.960
This is insane!
They're holding their own against captains!

233
00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:43.720
Does that woman have powers?!

234
00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.430
I'll take care of her. Stay back!

235
00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:52.100
Cien Fleur:

236
00:20:56.870 --> 00:20:57.940
Flip!

237
00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.240
Here we go!

238
00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:10.230
Thunder Ball!

239
00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:14.330
Thunderbolt Tempo!

240
00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:19.960
That'll do!

241
00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:32.350
So I guess these guys aren't
your typical grunts, huh?

242
00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:38.770
Two-Sword Style:

243
00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:45.240
Hawk Surge!

244
00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:51.080
Who's next?!

245
00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.330
Usopp!

246
00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:08.260
Luffy!

247
00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:16.230
Luffy!

248
00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:35.210
U-Usopp?

249
00:22:35.210 --> 00:22:39.580
S-So... you came?

250
00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:45.770
D-Don't get the wrong idea!

251
00:22:45.770 --> 00:22:50.390
I'm here to rescue Robin!

252
00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:55.260
I didn't come to see your face!

253
00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:57.740
Damn, what an ass!

254
00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:04.230
Hey, you! CP9's boss cat!

255
00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:11.530
I'm talking to you!
Now it's my turn! Bring it on!

256
00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:21.750
Th-That's right! I'm your opponent!

257
00:23:22.290 --> 00:23:23.040
Hey!

258
00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:27.770
Hey... don't! Don't! Hey!

259
00:23:28.610 --> 00:23:31.010
Leave him alone!

260
00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:34.750
You've already lost.
I have no business with you.

261
00:23:35.360 --> 00:23:38.140
They're all gonna die anyway.

262
00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:40.980
Just stay right there and watch.

263
00:23:41.860 --> 00:23:46.230
All right, come on, boss cat!
I'm gonna blow you away!

264
00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:51.610
Are you stupid?! Stop it, Usopp! He'll kill you!

265
00:23:51.610 --> 00:23:57.200
Shut up! What can you do
when you're almost dead?!

266
00:23:59.300 --> 00:24:02.370
He's mine! I'm gonna kick his ass!

267
00:24:02.980 --> 00:24:06.360
Then get up already!

268
00:24:06.360 --> 00:24:11.280
Stop looking like you're about to die!

269
00:24:12.490 --> 00:24:15.100
It's not like you!

270
00:24:20.050 --> 00:24:25.020
There may be nothing but smoke above us,
but we can still see the sky!

271
00:24:26.400 --> 00:24:29.030
We can see the sea, too!

272
00:24:35.370 --> 00:24:40.330
We're... We're not in hell!

273
00:24:46.140 --> 00:24:50.760
Stop acting like you're about to die, you jerk!

274
00:24:53.720 --> 00:24:58.150
Don't make us worry, dammit!

275
00:25:04.280 --> 00:25:05.750
I know!

276
00:25:08.390 --> 00:25:11.490
This isn't hell or anything close to it.

277
00:25:14.280 --> 00:25:15.820
Luffy!

278
00:25:23.750 --> 00:25:28.750
You have to beat him!
We're all going back together, Luffy!

279
00:25:29.590 --> 00:25:32.710
You're damn right!

280
00:25:37.320 --> 00:25:39.460
So you can still move?

281
00:25:42.780 --> 00:25:46.900
I never said... I'm done.

282
00:25:48.160 --> 00:25:49.850
Until I defeat you,

283
00:25:51.110 --> 00:25:55.990
I won't... hit the floor again!

284
00:26:00.420 --> 00:26:02.950
Vital Response: Terminate.

285
00:26:04.940 --> 00:26:08.350
I've had enough of this farce.

286
00:26:08.350 --> 00:26:11.380
My sheer power will crush you once and for all!

287
00:26:12.210 --> 00:26:15.340
Don't worry about your friends, Straw Hat.

288
00:26:16.480 --> 00:26:21.600
Since you wish to be together with them again,

289
00:26:22.380 --> 00:26:26.560
I'll send them to join you in hell!

290
00:26:40.430 --> 00:26:41.780
Spots!

291
00:26:57.420 --> 00:26:58.940
Luffy!

292
00:27:16.940 --> 00:27:17.900
Victory Bird!

293
00:27:23.130 --> 00:27:26.580
Dammit! What's their deal?!
I can't hit them!

294
00:27:35.580 --> 00:27:37.670
Hey! I won!

295
00:27:37.670 --> 00:27:39.710
Take this!

296
00:27:45.660 --> 00:27:48.810
Witness the power of the Berry Berry Fruit!

297
00:27:52.440 --> 00:27:55.110
Dammit! I'm trapped!

298
00:27:57.220 --> 00:27:59.490
There's nothing you can do!

299
00:28:00.700 --> 00:28:01.700
Thanks!

300
00:28:02.240 --> 00:28:05.490
Hey, you! Hold on a sec.

301
00:28:06.070 --> 00:28:09.110
If you like flying so much...

302
00:28:09.110 --> 00:28:10.610
Hey! D-Don't!

303
00:28:10.610 --> 00:28:12.620
Weapons Left!

304
00:28:15.690 --> 00:28:18.760
Careful! They've got ability users among them!

305
00:28:22.880 --> 00:28:24.390
They could say the same about us!

306
00:28:24.390 --> 00:28:27.970
Treinta Fleur: Clutch!

307
00:28:33.400 --> 00:28:35.480
So you are Roronoa Zoro?

308
00:28:36.700 --> 00:28:38.570
And if I am?

309
00:28:39.120 --> 00:28:41.110
I will defeat you!

310
00:28:41.780 --> 00:28:43.240
Fine!

311
00:28:48.980 --> 00:28:52.260
I ate the Rust Rust Fruit and became a rust man.

312
00:28:52.260 --> 00:28:54.460
You cannot defeat me.

313
00:28:55.440 --> 00:28:57.920
Dammit! My Yubashiri!

314
00:28:58.270 --> 00:29:03.300
I will turn those swords you cherish to rust.

315
00:29:04.000 --> 00:29:05.890
How intriguing.

316
00:29:07.350 --> 00:29:09.350
Let's give it a test.

317
00:29:15.850 --> 00:29:19.480
Now you get it, right?
You cannot defeat me with swords!

318
00:29:22.240 --> 00:29:26.200
I... I can't move my body!

319
00:29:26.680 --> 00:29:31.490
I rusted your joint. I will continue
until your entire body is rusted over!

320
00:29:31.490 --> 00:29:32.660
Dammit!

321
00:29:32.660 --> 00:29:34.710
Firebird Star!

322
00:29:41.090 --> 00:29:43.550
Are you okay, Zoro-kun?!

323
00:29:50.760 --> 00:29:54.310
Rubber Rubber Jet Pistol!

324
00:30:01.650 --> 00:30:05.930
Rubber Rubber Jet Pistol!

325
00:30:07.820 --> 00:30:09.640
I'm not gonna take another one of those!

326
00:30:11.780 --> 00:30:13.240
Ultimate Whorl:

327
00:30:14.500 --> 00:30:16.460
Six King Gun!

328
00:31:03.100 --> 00:31:05.220
Until I defeat you,

329
00:31:06.090 --> 00:31:10.800
I won't... hit the floor again!

330
00:31:25.410 --> 00:31:30.610
You'll soon regret that you took in such a vexatious woman.

331
00:31:31.200 --> 00:31:33.070
Rubber Rubber...

332
00:31:33.410 --> 00:31:36.870
We're through. You'll never see me again.

333
00:31:37.250 --> 00:31:41.580
This does not concern people like you.

334
00:31:41.710 --> 00:31:46.340
Robin intends to die for us!

335
00:31:49.220 --> 00:31:50.340
Iron Body!

336
00:31:53.050 --> 00:31:56.260
Are you insane?! Don't think
that you'll be able to survive...

337
00:31:56.260 --> 00:31:58.140
after making the entire world your enemy!

338
00:31:58.680 --> 00:32:02.940
I will pursue her to the ends
of the earth to eliminate her...

339
00:32:03.150 --> 00:32:05.570
I want to live!

340
00:32:09.150 --> 00:32:10.240
Jet...

341
00:32:11.990 --> 00:32:16.090
Gatling!

342
00:32:55.740 --> 00:32:57.180
What's going on?!

343
00:32:57.910 --> 00:32:59.200
What happened?!

344
00:33:03.090 --> 00:33:04.040
Luffy!

345
00:33:04.670 --> 00:33:05.830
Luffy!

346
00:33:08.000 --> 00:33:09.800
The first column!

347
00:33:13.600 --> 00:33:16.070
H-Hey, what's that?

348
00:33:16.070 --> 00:33:18.010
Hey! Look over there!

349
00:33:18.430 --> 00:33:20.790
Th-This is a report to all ships.

350
00:33:20.790 --> 00:33:22.390
This is a report to all ships!

351
00:33:22.930 --> 00:33:26.600
Mr. Rob Lucci of CP9 was just...

352
00:33:26.600 --> 00:33:34.170
was just defeated...
by the pirate Straw Hat Luffy!

353
00:33:39.980 --> 00:33:41.200
Luffy!

354
00:33:49.810 --> 00:33:51.050
It's over.

355
00:33:51.810 --> 00:33:54.300
We'll be okay now.

356
00:33:58.700 --> 00:34:02.600
We're gonna go back together!

357
00:34:03.210 --> 00:34:08.060
Robin!
